{"seq":1,"slug":"chronic-disease-and-health-monitoring","title":"慢性病与健康监测","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/health-management-and-care/chronic-disease-and-health-monitoring","wordCount":1170,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"慢性病与健康监测\">慢性病与健康监测</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>我外公同时有高血压和糖尿病，每天一把药。一开始我以为&quot;健康管理&quot;就是提醒他吃药，后来跟着社区医生学才知道，真正的功夫在于把指标长期稳定在安全区间里，而不是等他头晕了才量血压。这就是慢病管理和&quot;看病&quot;的根本区别——前者是长跑，后者是急救。</p>\n<p>这一节的核心：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>慢性病的特点</strong>：病程长、不可治愈但可控、多病共存（共病）。</li>\n<li><strong>健康档案</strong>：把老人的基础病、用药、指标历史集中记录，是健康管理的地基。</li>\n<li><strong>监测指标与阈值</strong>：血压、血糖、心率等都有&quot;安全区间&quot;，超出就要预警。</li>\n<li><strong>闭环管理</strong>：监测 → 预警 → 干预 → 复评，循环往复才叫管理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"老年慢性病为什么难管\">老年慢性病为什么难管</h3><p>老年慢性病有三个让人头疼的特点。第一，病程长，往往要管几十年；第二，治不好但能控制，目标不是&quot;痊愈&quot;而是&quot;不恶化、不出急性事件&quot;；第三，也是最棘手的——共病，一个老人身上常常叠着三四种病，高血压、糖尿病、冠心病、骨质疏松互相影响，吃这个药可能加重那个病。</p>\n<p>正因为这样，健康管理不能&quot;头痛医头&quot;，必须有一份完整的健康档案兜底。</p>\n<h3 id=\"健康档案-管理的地基\">健康档案：管理的地基</h3><p>一份合格的老年健康档案至少要包含：基础信息、慢性病诊断、长期用药清单、过敏史、历次监测指标。它的价值在于让任何一个接手的护理员或医生，都能在三分钟内掌握这位老人的全貌，避免重复检查、避免用药冲突。</p>\n<h3 id=\"监测指标与预警阈值\">监测指标与预警阈值</h3><p>健康监测的本质，是把一些关键指标和它的&quot;安全区间&quot;做对比。以血压为例，老年人常用的控制目标可以表示为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>收缩压目标</mtext><mo>:</mo><mn>130</mn><mo>≤</mo><mtext>SBP</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>140</mn><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>mmHg</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{收缩压目标}: 130 \\le \\text{SBP} &lt; 140 \\ (\\text{mmHg})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">收缩压目标</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7804em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">130</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SBP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">140</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mmHg</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>意思是收缩压控制在 130 到 140 之间相对理想（具体目标因人而异，需医生判断）。监测系统做的事，就是不断把测得的值和这个区间比对：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>预警</mtext><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">{</mo><mtable rowspacing=\"0.36em\" columnalign=\"left left\" columnspacing=\"1em\"><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>是</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>SBP</mtext><mo>≥</mo><mn>160</mn><mtext> 或 SBP</mtext><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>90</mn></mrow></mstyle></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mrow><mtext>否</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo></mrow></mstyle></mtd><mtd><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\" displaystyle=\"false\"><mtext>其他</mtext></mstyle></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{预警} = \\begin{cases} \\text{是}, &amp; \\text{SBP} \\ge 160 \\ \\text{或} \\ \\text{SBP} &lt; 90 \\\\ \\text{否}, &amp; \\text{其他} \\end{cases}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">预警</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3em;vertical-align:-1.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">{</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mtable\"><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">是</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">否</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"arraycolsep\" style=\"width:1em;\"></span><span class=\"col-align-l\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.69em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.69em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SBP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">160</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">或</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SBP</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.25em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.008em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">其他</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.19em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>下面是几个常用监测指标的参考（具体以医嘱为准）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>常见关注阈值</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>收缩压 SBP</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>160</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 160</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">160</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>90</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 90</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90</span></span></span></span></span> mmHg</td>\n<td>过高或过低都危险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空腹血糖</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>7.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ge 7.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7.0</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3.9</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 3.9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3.9</span></span></span></span></span> mmol/L</td>\n<td>低血糖对老人尤其凶险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>静息心率</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 50</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span></span></span></span></span> 次/分</td>\n<td>异常需结合症状</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>血氧 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>SpO</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SpO}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9275em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SpO</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>提示缺氧</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>特别提醒：对老人来说，低血糖（血糖低于 3.9）有时比高血糖更危险，因为它来得快、可能直接导致昏迷。</p>\n<h3 id=\"闭环-管理才有意义\">闭环：管理才有意义</h3><p>光监测不行，得形成闭环。下面这张图是慢病管理的核心循环：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[采集指标] --&gt; B[对比阈值]&#10;    B --&gt; C{超出安全区?}&#10;    C --&gt;|是| D[预警并干预]&#10;    C --&gt;|否| E[记录归档]&#10;    D --&gt; F[调整用药/生活方式]&#10;    F --&gt; G[复评]&#10;    G --&gt; A&#10;    E --&gt; A\">flowchart LR\n    A[采集指标] --&gt; B[对比阈值]\n    B --&gt; C{超出安全区?}\n    C --&gt;|是| D[预警并干预]\n    C --&gt;|否| E[记录归档]\n    D --&gt; F[调整用药/生活方式]\n    F --&gt; G[复评]\n    G --&gt; A\n    E --&gt; A</pre><p>只有当&quot;测出异常—通知到人—采取措施—再次复评&quot;完整跑起来，监测设备才真正产生价值，否则它只是一堆没人看的数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>一位老人空腹血糖测得 3.5 mmol/L，参照上表判断是否需要预警，并说说该优先处理高血糖还是低血糖。</li>\n<li>帮一位虚拟老人设计一份健康档案，列出你认为最不能漏的五项内容。</li>\n<li>为什么说&quot;光监测不算管理&quot;？用慢病闭环图解释一遍。</li>\n<li>共病为什么让用药变得复杂？举一个&quot;治 A 病的药可能加重 B 病&quot;的例子（可上网查证）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>国家基本公共卫生服务里的&quot;老年人健康管理&quot;项目，是了解规范化健康档案的好入口。</li>\n<li>各类慢性病防治指南（高血压、糖尿病）会给出权威的控制目标，记得认准最新版本。</li>\n<li>找一款养老健康监测 App 体验一下它怎么设置阈值和预警，对照本节内容看实现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>这一节我们把&quot;健康管理&quot;从&quot;提醒吃药&quot;升级成了一套&quot;档案—监测—阈值—闭环&quot;的系统思维，核心是把指标稳在安全区间。但健康监测管的是身体内部的数据，老人每天更直接面对的是吃饭、洗澡、起身这些日常照护——下一节我们就走到床边，讲日常照护与康复。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"慢性病与健康监测","id":"慢性病与健康监测"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"老年慢性病为什么难管","id":"老年慢性病为什么难管"},{"level":3,"text":"健康档案：管理的地基","id":"健康档案-管理的地基"},{"level":3,"text":"监测指标与预警阈值","id":"监测指标与预警阈值"},{"level":3,"text":"闭环：管理才有意义","id":"闭环-管理才有意义"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"政策与产业格局","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/aging-and-service-system/policy-and-industry-landscape"},"next":{"title":"日常照护与康复","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/vocational-bachelor/smart-elderly-care/health-management-and-care/daily-care-and-rehabilitation"}}